THICAL CONSIDERATIONS\nWhile it has been demonstrated that PLMs are powerful in language understanding (Devlin et al., 2019; Liu et al., 2019; Clark et al., 2020), there are studies pointing out their drawbacks such as containing social bias (Liang et al., 2021) and misinformation (Abid et al., 2021). In our work, we focus on enriching PLMs\u2019 text encoding process with the associated network structure information, which could be a way to mitigate the bias and wipe out the contained misinformation."
